---
description: >-
  A message and a note rendered with distinct actor/message/note font families,
  sizes, and note alignment all set via config.
config:
  look: classic
  sequence:
    actorFontFamily: courier
    actorFontSize: 14
    messageFontFamily: Arial
    messageFontSize: 12
    noteFontFamily: times
    noteFontSize: 16
    noteAlign: left
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant participant0@{ "type" : "participant" }
  participant actor1@{ "type" : "actor" }
  participant boundary2@{ "type" : "boundary" }
  participant0 ->> actor1: Regular message
  Note right of actor1: Regular note
